#: ../../source/users/schema/layers.rst:28
msgid ""
"The layer level from multiples objects can be defined at the same time "
"`selecting multiple objects`_."
msgstr "可以 `选择多个对象 <selecting multiple objects_>`_ 来同时定义多个对象的图层级别。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/layers.rst:30
msgid ""
"The level from each `element`_ or `picture`_ can be defined from `menu "
"bar`_, `toolbar`_, by right click on the object and using the corresponding "
"keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""
"每个 `元件 <element_>`_ 或 `图片 <picture_>`_ 的图层级别可以通过 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 、`工具栏 "
"<toolbar_>`_ 、右键单击对象以及相应的键盘快捷键来定义。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/layers.rst:34
msgid "Define object layer from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏定义对象图层"

#: ../../source/users/schema/layers.rst:36
#: ../../source/users/schema/layers.rst:47
#: ../../source/users/schema/layers.rst:57
#: ../../source/users/schema/layers.rst:70
msgid "`Select the object/s`_ which layer level should be defined."
msgstr "`Select the object/s`_ （选择要定义图层级别的对象）。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/layers.rst:37
msgid "Select **Edit** menu and the desired action."
msgstr "选择 **编辑** 菜单和所需操作。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/layers.rst:42
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/schema/layers.rst:45
msgid "Define object layer from toolbar"
msgstr "从工具栏定义对象图层"

#: ../../source/users/schema/layers.rst:48
msgid ""
"Select the corresponding icon from `toolbar`_ (icons from above table) to "
"realize the desired action."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 中选择相应的图标（见上表），以执行所需操作。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/layers.rst:52
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Depth**"
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 未显示，可通过 **设置 > 显示 > 层级** 将其显示出来。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/layers.rst:55
msgid "Define object layer by right click"
msgstr "通过右键单击定义对象图层"

#: ../../source/users/schema/layers.rst:58
msgid "Right click and select the desired layer definition action."
msgstr "右键单击并选择所需的图层定义操作。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/layers.rst:63
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element right click items"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元件右键单击菜单项"

#: ../../source/users/schema/layers.rst:66
msgid "Define object layer using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键定义对象图层"

#: ../../source/users/schema/layers.rst:68
msgid ""
"As many other tools, QElectroTech is an applications which allows using "
"keyboard shortcut."
msgstr "与许多其他工具一样，QElectroTech 也是一款允许使用键盘快捷键的应用程序。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/layers.rst:71
msgid ""
"Press the corresponding keyboard shortcut (keyboard shortcut from above "
"table) to realize the desired action."
msgstr "按下相应的键盘快捷键（见上表），以执行所需操作。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/layers.rst:75
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcuts, refer to `menu "
